        <tei:p>This is the invocation of Rabbi Ferdinand M. Isserman offered at the Republican National Convention in Chicago, Illinois on 16 June 1932, as found in <tei:hi rend="italic">The Washington Times</tei:hi>, “The Rabbi Prayes for Nation’s Needy at Convention.” Many thanks to Howard Mortman for bringing this prayer to our attention.</tei:p>
